.TH "PERCH-ACCOUNT-ENABLE" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-account\-enable \- enable an account
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch account enable [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Re\-enable a previously disabled account.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-email <value>
account email
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch account enable \-\-email you@example.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-account\fR(1)
